15:## Phạm vi ảnh hưởng
16:
17:| Khu vực | Thay đổi |
18:|---|---|
19:| Backend tournaments | New candidate/add/direct/claim routes; reuse existing self-consent route; note and guest repository/DTOs; manager and source eligibility checks |
20:| Backend schema | `organizer_note` and `tournament_guest_rosters`; migration generated/reviewed, not applied to real DB |
21:| Backend rankings | Gate direct update and replay against `isRanked`; ensure enqueue uses completion timestamp; preserve admin history |
22:| Backend scheduler | active roster/tournament filter, safe HTML, cross-instance serialized dispatch, retry/counter assertions |
23:| Web | Add Athlete dialog beside spreadsheet import; friends/club/direct modes; note/presence/fee snapshot; player consent/claim UI |
24:| Flutter | Optional player consent and response model/client compatibility; no organizer UI unless existing consumer proves one exists |
25:| Excel/wildcard | unchanged |
26:
27:## Negative cases
28:
29:| Case | Required behavior |
30:|---|---|
31:| non-manager/unverified caller | 403; no candidate or write |
32:| friend pending/rejected/soft-deleted at write time | reject; no participant/roster row |
33:| club member removed or tournament not associated with club | reject |
34:| user already on active roster | conflict; no duplicate |
35:| guest direct entry without email | succeeds with one-time claim credential; no synthetic account/email |
…
40:| mail failure | retry remains eligible; delivered-send counter unchanged |
